<title>CANADA: Petro-Canada cuts posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Petro-Canada cuts posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro-Canada said it lowered the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$4.00/cubic metre or C$0.64/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$198.00/cubic metre, or C$31.48/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$194.00/cubic metre, or C$30.84/barrel</p>
<p>Hardisty medium C$175.00/cubic metre, or C$27.82/barrel</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
